Neither LaTeX nor `.format` handles LaTeX output itself — those are formatting commands for your written document. To get LaTeX formulas into your document:

1. Use `\input` with `.tex` or `.tex` filename
2. Or write to a multi-line string and read with `\input`
3. Or use `\documentclass{article}` directly with standard TeX commands

For \textsuperscript{1} elements (including `.format` output):
```latex
